/T (A modern automated vaccine delivery system uses advanced sensors and embedded technologies to ensure safe and efficient vaccine transportation. It continuously measures important parameters such as storage temperature, payload weight, and delivery location to maintain proper vaccine conditions. The collected data is processed using a microcontroller such as Arduino Uno  and can be monitored in real time. GPS technology allows live location  tracking of the vaccine carrier, while temperature sensors ensure that  vaccines remain within the recommended storage range. confirm proper handling during delivery.  LED indicators and buzzer alerts provide warning notifications whenever  abnormal conditions such as temperature changes or delivery issues occur.  The entire system is powered using a regulated power supply for stable  operation. These systems are widely used in hospitals, healthcare centers,  medical logistics, and vaccination campaigns to improve delivery reliability  and reduce vaccine wastage. )
/E (A modern automated vaccine delivery system uses advanced sensors and embedded technologies to ensure safe and efficient vaccine transportation. It continuously measures important parameters such as storage temperature, payload weight, and delivery location to maintain proper vaccine conditions. The collected data is processed using a microcontroller such as Arduino Uno  and can be monitored in real time. GPS technology allows live location  tracking of the vaccine carrier, while temperature sensors ensure that  vaccines remain within the recommended storage range. confirm proper handling during delivery.  LED indicators and buzzer alerts provide warning notifications whenever  abnormal conditions such as temperature changes or delivery issues occur.  The entire system is powered using a regulated power supply for stable  operation. These systems are widely used in hospitals, healthcare centers,  medical logistics, and vaccination campaigns to improve delivery reliability  and reduce vaccine wastage. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [13]
>>
