785 0 obj
<<
/Title (depends mainly on manual checking and traditional cold storage methods. Healthcare workers must physically inspect temperature conditions and delivery status, which is time-consuming and often inaccurate.  There is no continuous real-time monitoring of vaccine temperature or  transportation conditions. Delays in delivery or unexpected temperature  variations can damage vaccines and reduce their effectiveness. Lack of  proper tracking also makes it difficult to monitor delivery routes and ensure  timely transportation. Managing vaccine transportation manually increases  operational costs, human effort, and the possibility of vaccine wastage.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 773 0 R
/Prev 784 0 R
>>
endobj
